{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人朱智賢（朱朱）日前為HOY訪談節目《九運會客室2》擔任嘉賓，重提當年的「偷食事件」，她表示事後感到非常混亂及慌張，當年與前度謝東閔在記者會發表的內容全由無綫安排，由於謝東閔也覺得她不宜多說，故大部分內容都交由男方發言。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:23:55.468538+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:05:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.151893+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.151893+00:00","content_hash":"7b6e47403c9729c6a83d44270f94358088251b2b20c4af4a828000516288f84c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}